# Appelo, Parkhurst, and Post (2014), Figure 1.
# These ion volumes give the current SUPCRT-coefficient I=0 salt volumes.
# They are not the fitted HKFmoRR intercepts in paper Table 2. The current
# implementation also does not include the concentration terms in Eq. (6).
SPECIESLIST
H+
Na+
Ca+2
Cl-
/ end

TEMPS
25
/ end

PRESSURES
1.01325
/ end

TempUnit C
PresUnit bar
IncludeIndex 0
